  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) This paper aims to systematically benchmark contemporary machine-learning methods for predicting spatially resolved gene expression from H&E histopathology images, using broad spatial, biological, and downstream-analysis metrics to evaluate accuracy, robustness, limitations, generalizability, and clinical-translation potential.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
